ds and monsters in one of the few dozen screens worldwide with the capability to screen Imax in 70mm. It also has the potential to rule the box office for the coming weeks, with few other true blockbusters to be released this summer, with the exception of Spider-Man: Brand New Day (hence the castâ€™s <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/20/hollywood-press-tours-gimmicky">humiliation ritual</a> of a press tour). Read on for a spoiler-packed breakdown of the epic battles, narrative twists and out-of-nowhere cameos that bring richness to Nolanâ€™s idiosyncratic vision of ancient life.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/21/odyssey-christopher-nolan-discussion">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;bgFTKbHrYMZgcv45NncPDnwGJpo-klTHww0soV0AO9Aƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxYThe Odyssey: jaw-dropping action, dark magic and dolphin cameos â€“ discuss with spoilersƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;JoVGQRsppO_VChJs2iPT5GBc-9boI_ZY2LP2CeZNbNcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;hH8vTDQOBo4ktYxI_ldi99hpeSrSWMNqZWjekLLD278ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxQhttps://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/21/odyssey-christopher-nolan-discussionƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;NOq19reH1sHLPlab45CnSHAsmR5bbreQg4Xxihub-Mgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxSthe-odyssey-jaw-dropping-action-dark-magic-and-dolphin-cameos-discuss-with-spoilersƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;l1gzaJJgqvgtvuaH0t_zLt6gpSyr6FtJq-TngE2kfTUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundl